{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01TxNmguqfu5QmMyucwkjnJn","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_11/projects/turn_residual_gating/ROADMAP.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# turn_residual_gating — Research Dashboard\\\\n\\\\n> 最后更新: 2026-05-19 14:54 UTC | 更新原因: plan_015 DONE (bootstrap CI confirms zero benefit), disk strategy corrected (246GB data disk), re-dream launched\\\\n\\\\n> 核心方向详见 paper_framing.md | 实验列表详见 experiment_plan.yaml\\\\n\\\\n## 核心方向\\\\n**Route B: Negative result + mechanistic insight** — lightweight residual gating 在 teacher-forcing 下的 auxiliary attention loss 泛化失败。核心卖点：exposure bias 在 auxiliary attention loss 上的首个定量测量（30x gap）+ 失败机制 taxonomy。\\\\n\\\\n**目标 venue**: EMNLP 2026（ARR August cycle, deadline 2026-08-03, ~10 weeks）\\\\n\\\\n## 当前进展\\\\n- **阶段**: Research（post-MVP, framing 收窄 D022, Eq.3 修正 D023）\\\\n- **Re-dream**: `dream_20260519T145320` 已启动（full review mode, 修正后 focus），预计 15-25 min\\\\n- **Qwen 实验**: C1-C4 全部完成 ✅（含 held-out eval + bootstrap CI）\\\\n- **plan_015 (bootstrap CI)**: 所有 GAR-ours/PPL 95% CI 包含 0，统计确认 \\\\\\\"zero benefit\\\\\\\"。W7 已回应。\\\\n- **plan_017 (D023)**: Eq.3 公式与代码语义相反已确认。Paper Agent 写作时修正。\\\\n- **C3 注意**: plan_006/007 已完成但缺 registry_id，Agent 处理中\\\\n- **GPU**: westd-20861:cuda:0 空闲 → urgent 已派 plan_016\\\\n\\\\n## 核心 Claims (Route B)\\\\n| Claim | 状态 | 证据 |\\\\n|-------|------|------|\\\\n| C1: GAR 衰减 70.8% | ✅ | Phase 1 |\\\\n| C2: 训练-推理 30x 断层 | ✅ | v7 训练+eval; held-out 确认 |\\\\n| C3: 三个失败机制 | ✅ | 梯度冲突+gate profile+attention heatmap (缺 registry_id) |\\\\n| C4: 四路消融 gating 零增量 | ✅✅ | D021 + held-out + **bootstrap CI (所有 95% CI 含 0)** |\\\\n| C5: 跨模型验证 | ⬜ | Llama-3 (plan_009-012, MUST-HAVE) |\\\\n\\\\n## 近期任务\\\\n- [x] paper_framing.md 收窄 claim scope (D022)\\\\n- [x] plan_008 held-out eval — 三路趋同鲁棒复现\\\\n- [x] plan_017: code-paper 架构验证 — Eq.3 mismatch confirmed (D023)