训练-推理 GAR 断层确认为 GAR 过拟合（非 measurement bug）。发现实 | phase2_tg_s42_v7, phase2_ug_s42, phase2_lora_only_s42 |\\\\n| D014 | 2026-05-19 | Gate-profile 揭示 turn conditioning 反向学习：27/28 层 gat | phase2_tg_s42_v7, phase2_ug_s42, phase2_lora_only_s42 |\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 3647, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01Ub5RMtPGvo9XoBAoux2rVU","session_id":"9debb1e7-35e3-43a0-95c7-459e69966cf9","uuid":"94323abb-787b-4ece-832c-bab0402b16ea","timestamp":"2026-05-19T15:38:45.636Z"}
