\\\\n- [x] plan_015: Bootstrap CI — 所有 CI 含 0，统计确认 zero benefit\\\\n- [ ] **plan_016: Exposure-bias mitigation test (8h GPU)** ← urgent 已派 Agent\\\\n- [ ] plan_006/007: 补 registry_id（Agent 处理中）\\\\n- [ ] **⚠️ Paper Agent 写 Method 前必须修正 Eq.3**: 用 `x+g·f(x)`，修正机制叙事\\\\n- [ ] Llama-3 下载到 data disk（与 plan_016 并行，零 GPU 空转）\\\\n- [ ] Re-dream 验证 framing 修正（dream_20260519T145320 运行中）\\\\n- [ ] plan_009-012: Llama-3 跨模型验证（~15h, 待 re-dream 通过）\\\\n- [ ] plan_014: Downstream task sanity check (P2, 1h)\\\\n\\\\n## GPU 执行序列\\\\n1. **plan_016** (Qwen, 8h) — exposure-bias mitigation，**同时**下载 Llama-3 到 data disk\\\\n2. plan_016 完成后**直接**启动 **plan_009-012** (Llama-3, ~15h)（无需清 cache，两模型共存于不同磁盘）\\\\n3. plan_013/014 (如时间允许)\\\\n\\\\n## GPU 预算\\\\n- 已分配: westd-20861:cuda:0（plan_016 启动中）\\\\n- 已用: ~41.6 GPU·h\\\\n- 剩余: plan_016(8h) + Llama-3(15.5h) + downstream(1h) = ~24.5h\\\\n- 磁盘: root 15G/30G (Qwen) + **data disk 246G/250G (Llama-3)**，两模型可共存\\\\n\\\\n## 关键决策日志\\\\n\\\\n| ID | 日期 | 摘要 | 关联实验 |\\\\n|----|------|------|----------|\\\\n| D023 | 2026-05-19 | Eq.3 code-paper formula mismatch confirmed (plan_0 | plan_017 |\\\\n| D022 | 2026-05-19 | Dream review 分析: 收窄 claim scope + 补充 3 个实验 (bootst | phase2_4way_eval, phase2_tg_s42_v7 |\\\\n| D021 | 2026-05-19 | Route B 正式确认：四路 eval 三路趋同（GAR 差异<0.6pp, PPL 差异<0.0 | phase2_lora_only_s42, phase2_tg_s42_v7, phase2_ug_s42 |\\\\n| D020 | 2026-05-19 | Llama-3 最小验证方案扩展为 Base + TG + LoRA-only（Reviewer 建 | phase2_tg_s42_v7 |\\\\n| D019 | 2026-05-19 | v7 中间 checkpoint：选 Option B（3 epoch checkpoint 粗粒度 | phase2_tg_s42_v7 |\\\\n| D018 | 2026-05-19 | Reviewer 深度分析：Route A 成功概率从 20-30% 修正至 <5%，根本矛盾是 t | phase2_lora_only_s42, phase2_tg_s42_v7, phase2_ug_s42 |\\\\n| D017 | 2026-05-19 | 采纳 Reviewer 两路策略：准备路线 B 框架（negative result + mecha | phase2_tg_s42_v7, phase2_ug_s42, phase2_lora_only_s42 |\\\\n| D016 | 2026-05-19 | Two-stage decoupled training：有条件尝试（~20-30% 成功率）。以  | phase2_tg_s42_v7, phase2_ug_s42, phase2_lora_only_s42 |\\\\n| D015 | 2026-05-19 | 30x 训练-推理 GAR 断层确认为 GAR 过拟合（非 measurement bug）。发现实 | phase2_tg_s42_v7, phase2_ug_s42, phase2_lora_only_s42 |\\\\n| D014 | 2026-05-19 | Gate-profile 揭示 turn conditioning 反向学习：27/28 层 gat | phase2_tg_s42_v7, phase2_ug_s42, phase2_lora_only_s42 |\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 3647, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01MAZXQRSSMdKDDhvc1sZbsh","session_id":"9debb1e7-35e3-43a0-95c7-459e69966cf9","uuid":"153de78b-b801-407e-972a-ad5b3c4fb85a","timestamp":"2026-05-19T15:39:17.659Z"}
